    Bug 2001705 - change "uid validity seems to have changed" from assertion to warning. r=BenC


    Doesn't seem this should be an assertion as it happens frequently.
     ###!!! ASSERTION: uid validity seems to have changed, blowing away db: 'imapUIDValidity == kUidUnknown', file /builds/worker/checkouts/gecko/comm/mailnews/imap/src/nsImapMailFolder.cpp:X)

    There's a risk comm/mailnews/imap/test/unit/test_offlineCopy.js will now start intermittently failing instead.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D277431

diff --git a/mailnews/imap/src/nsImapMailFolder.cpp b/mailnews/imap/src/nsImapMailFolder.cpp
index 76f2a59f7b1..a873a686335 100644
--- a/mailnews/imap/src/nsImapMailFolder.cpp
+++ b/mailnews/imap/src/nsImapMailFolder.cpp
@@ -2468,8 +2468,7 @@ NS_IMETHODIMP nsImapMailFolder::UpdateImapMailboxInfo(
   m_uidValidity = folderValidity;

   if (imapUIDValidity != folderValidity) {
-    NS_ASSERTION(imapUIDValidity == kUidUnknown,
-                 "uid validity seems to have changed, blowing away db");
+    NS_WARNING("uid validity seems to have changed, blowing away db");
     nsCOMPtr<nsIFile> pathFile;
     rv = GetFilePath(getter_AddRefs(pathFile));
     if (NS_FAILED(rv)) return rv;
